@startuml UC-A2-sign-out-analysis-sequence
!include ../../domain/diagrams/_style.puml
hide footbox
title UC-A2 Sign out (analysis: system sequence, built)
' Analysis level (decision 9): the person, Playground as one box, and Keycloak as an outside system.
' No route, store, port, adapter, token or cookie. Step numbers are the main flow numbers of UC-A2.
' Decision 15: no sign in of ours means home and Keycloak is not asked.
' Not drawn: saying on screen that Keycloak could not be reached (not built, listed under Before beta).

actor "Person" as P
participant "Playground" as PG #E6F0FB
participant "Keycloak\n(outside)" as K #ECECEC

alt a link or image on another site sends a GET
  P -> PG : GET to the sign out address
  PG --> P : nothing happens (AC-71)
else the person asks to sign out (POST)
  P -> PG : 1 ask to sign out
  PG -> PG : 2 end my sign in\nwith Playground
  alt no sign in of ours, or it cannot be read
    PG --> P : 3 home page,\nKeycloak is not asked
  else Keycloak address cannot be built
    PG --> P : 3 home page,\nsigned out
  else
    PG --> P : 3 go to Keycloak\nto end your sign in
    P -> K : 3 end my sign in
    K -> K : 4 end my sign in
    K --> P : 4 back to home page (AC-72)
    P -> PG : 4 home page
    PG --> P : 4 you are signed out
  end
end
P -> PG : 5 ask for something
PG --> P : 5 sign in again
@enduml
